Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.84,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,If you placed Mount Everest at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.89,0:00:05.05,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,bottom of The Mariana Trench,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.95,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,its snowy peak would still be buried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.69,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,under two kilometers of pitch-black ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:12.20,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Welcome to CurioSphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:15.46,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Today, we descend into the hadal zone—a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:17.26,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,realm of crushing pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:20.29,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,alien life, and mysteries science is only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.80,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,beginning to decipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:24.41,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,As you leave the sunlit surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:27.56,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,light disappears entirely within two hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:30.46,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Below that lies a world so hostile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:33.35,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,that walking on the surface of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:36.25,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Moon is physically easier than visiting its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:37.30,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.51,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,At eleven thousand meters down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:42.41,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,the water pressure reaches over one thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:43.92,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,times atmospheric pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:46.82,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Any standard submarine would be crushed like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:48.34,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,a soda can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:51.36,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Yet here, ghostly snailfish and translucent amphipods
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.38,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,glide effortlessly, using unique organic molecules called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:57.28,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,piezolytes to prevent their cellular machinery from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:58.33,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:01.35,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Near the seabed, hydrothermal chimneys spew mineral-rich
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:04.49,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,water heated to four hundred degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.29,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,In this sunlight-deprived darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:09.43,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,life does not depend on the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:11.64,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Microbes consume toxic hydrogen sulfide,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:14.54,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,forming the base of an entirely independent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:15.64,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:18.54,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,We have mapped more of the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:21.44,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,of Mars than we have mapped of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.36,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,our own ocean trenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:26.26,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Every expedition brings back species never before
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:29.40,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,classified by science—reminding us of how little
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:32.14,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,we know about our own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:35.04,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,The depths of our planet still harbor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:37.77,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,ancient secrets waiting in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:40.67,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,What do you think is waiting to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:43.82,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,be discovered in the deepest ocean trenches?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:46.43,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,Share your theory in the comments,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.00,CurioSphereMain,,0,0,0,,and subscribe to CurioSphere for more journeys
